{"title":"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Cheese)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Cheese)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb585cf00813bdd2463638c0144c9e6464975e3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\sqrt{\\sin^4{x} + 4 \\cos^2{x}} - \\sqrt{\\cos^4{x} + 4 \\sin^2{x}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"370\" height=\"26\" /> An equivalent form of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/2/0c2e1cc1276964d1d0cd3761681bc32e1b6468cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }1-\\sqrt{2}\\sin{x} \\qquad \\text{(B) }-1+\\sqrt{2}\\cos{x} \\qquad \\text{(C) }\\cos{\\frac{x}{2}} - \\sin{\\frac{x}{2}} \\qquad \\text{(D) }\\cos{x} - \\sin{x} \\qquad \\text{(E) }\\cos{2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"755\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the Pythagorean identity we can rewrite the given expression as follows.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/f/76fd328cc3082be82153f05f4699189b4acaf14f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\sin^4{x} + 4 \\cos^2{x}} - \\sqrt{\\cos^4{x} + 4 \\sin^2{x}} = \\sqrt{\\sin^4{x} + 4(1 - \\sin^2{x})} - \\sqrt{\\cos^4{x} + 4(1 - \\cos^2{x})}\\]\" width=\"698\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>Expanding each bracket gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/a/61ada9aeac0d86fa84230ff82494906135d8dbff.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\sin^4{x} - 4\\sin^2{x} + 4} - \\sqrt{\\cos^4{x} - 4\\cos^2{x} + 4}\\]\" width=\"362\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>The expressions under the square roots can be factored to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/b/dbb262cb129885ed16b1d43194005bb0f660404e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{(\\sin^2{x} - 2)^2} - \\sqrt{(\\cos^2{x} - 2)^2}\\]\" width=\"251\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/4/8f4cf4b8893bb917f40a99565a1681f725af8bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2{x} &lt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f7062f0e2a4bf6e7d56307398a067d51c897327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2{x} &lt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> for all real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, the expression must evaluate to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/9/c49818c4e3ffd05b2a64858052d6d74a626b2d8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 - \\sin^2{x}) - (2 - \\cos^2{x})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"203\" height=\"22\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da986a961b821dd13960c9524373bfe65ed28d53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2{x} - \\sin^2{x} = \\boxed {\\text{(E) }\\cos{2x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"228\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Cheese.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Cheese)\">Solution 2 (Cheese)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Cheese)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We don't actually have to solve the question. Just let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equal some easy value to calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/1/4d1e108ca072b940fc24dc628e1d0a66d2a9f778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos {x}, \\cos {2x}, \\sin {x}, \\sin {\\frac{x}{2}},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"191\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/5/6f506582212698bcc7b754479e1294ea0d900b5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos {\\frac{x}{2}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"34\" /> For this solution, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a577a6a16858cf2d8f5a49817f4de27b5e1a5a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=60^\\circ.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" /> This means that the expression in the problem will give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/b/4cb2af6f1fa269116a713f03ee730944853d4c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\sin^4{60^\\circ} + 4 \\cos^2{60^\\circ}} - \\sqrt{\\cos^4{60^\\circ} + 4 \\sin^2{60^\\circ}}=\\sqrt{(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})^4 + 4(\\frac{1}{2})^2} - \\sqrt{(\\frac{1}{2})^4 + 4(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})^2}=\\sqrt{\\frac{9}{16} +1} - \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{16} + 3} = \\frac{-1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"926\" height=\"56\" /> Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/8/ae847efc689fd9f5c09a0b5d876fcc3a47d4af7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" /> for the rest of the expressions, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/76339e311a489ef8c29fcb8d909679e30f786f51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }1-\\sqrt{2}\\sin{60^\\circ}=1-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2} \\neq \\frac{-1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"283\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b6863b84e6026f93c08255b7408889d8b8c8ce5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B) }1+\\sqrt{2}\\cos{60^\\circ}=1+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\neq \\frac{-1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"284\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6b7c013e92b1d6d0f96e3e5f0779fe7d511edac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C) }\\cos{\\frac{60^\\circ}{2}} - \\sin{\\frac{60^\\circ}{2}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}-1 \\neq \\frac{-1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"310\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b30d66d5d42f25d064bac33ebb2146b51f48923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D) }\\cos{60^\\circ} - \\sin{60^\\circ}=\\frac{1-\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\neq \\frac{-1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"303\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/9/0e9783a6783a03e45199e3e3a851fec0f16be9f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E) }\\cos {120^\\circ}=\\frac{-1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"153\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe467af11addc51b74a2419e0e092f6af879eae8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } \\cos {2x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>Comment: If you decide to cheese the problem, be very careful not to choose any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/d/11d3791d908578e9ede8da9a29fefa2429468419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"13\" height=\"33\" />. It turns out that all of them except for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/a/82a161cd9063f544a8ddd76c73b664701fc24973.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7\\pi}{4} + 2\\pi k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" /> result in equality between the correct answer and one or more wrong answers, which one could quickly verify by setting two choices equal and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P\">2002 AMC 12P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017145038\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 238/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6155/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.119      1 -total\n 59.20%    8.359      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 